WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
A newborn's lips are
touched with honey and ghee.

2
00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:08.170
At about six months, the baby's first
taste of sweet rice comes from a silver

3
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.270
spoon.

4
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:13.680
At a wedding, the couple take
seven steps around a sacred fire.

5
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:19.530
And at the very end, some families in
Britain fly a small urn of ashes 4,000 miles

6
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.830
to a river.

7
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.510
Why go so far?

8
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.140
In this mission, you'll follow
the Hindu rites that mark life,

9
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.680
from before birth to the
sacred thread and marriage.

10
00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.490
Then you'll see what
happens at a Hindu funeral,

11
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.640
and how families in
Britain adapt the rites.

12
00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:40.590
Your mission: find out why the river
matters so much at the end of a life.
